      "side": 1,
      "message": "More or less agree with Diana. I think there is some fundamental reudantancy we should get rid of:\n\n1. make charger_get_* routines cache values and return values from cache (unless immediate values are requested).\n2. make code referencing chg.voltage/current/input_current/status/options call charger_get*. \n3. Get rid of charger_get_params from the charger_task loop.\n\n---\u003e8---\n\ncurr.chg is referenced only by charge_command_charge_state(for EC_CMD_CHARGE_STATE) and charger_profile_override. We can make these explicitly call charger_get_params or individual get_ routines.",
